OL,3,GNEWSATrain fault causes widespread
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA train fault has blocked a railway
OL,7,Fline causing disruption for
OL,8,FCrossCountry services.
OL,10,FThe fault happened on a train at
OL,11,FStamford in Lincolnshire that was
OL,12,Ftravelling between Peterborough and
OL,13,FLeicester.
OL,15,FThe line towards Birmingham New Street
OL,16,Fwas blocked and trains running on the
OL,17,Fline could be cancelled or delayed,
OL,18,FNational Rail said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
