OL,3,GNEWSATrain fault causes widespread
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisruption is expected until 09:45 BST
OL,7,Fand a full list of alternative routes
OL,8,Fis available on the National Rail
OL,9,Fwebsite.
